{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Zul'Gurub: High Priestess Jeklik's Bat-tering Charge skips players within 8 yards",
  "contract": [
    "The testers of 2026-11-13 report that her Bat-tering Charge (2106125) hits melee players. Our charge took",
    "any player out of melee (5 yards in bat form) and within 25 yards; the user decided on 2026-11-13 to take",
    "stock Jeklik's minimum as well, so she charges only players beyond 8 yards. Her bat form charges 2 s in and",
    "every 20 s after that, and screeches in place of the charge when nobody is in reach. The close hero stands",
    "about 8 yards from her, out of melee, and the far hero about 35 yards away: before the fix the close hero was",
    "the one player in reach 2 s in, so a charge came; now none comes. Then the far hero steps in to about 18",
    "yards and is the only player in reach at the next charge, which must land on them. Fear Ward keeps the tank",
    "and the close hero in place through the first Screech.",
    "Her bat form wipes her threat, and the hero who struck her last would draw her into melee; the tank is a",
    "raid-bot tank whose threat floor keeps her on the tank, so the close hero stays out of her melee range.",
    "Until the tank has engaged her, the other heroes wait about 34 yards away, where the far hero backs off to,",
    "and then come back beside the tank: she aggroes a hero beside her the moment she appears, and a hero she",
    "chased as they backed away would end up in charge range."
  ],
